{
  "id": "ct-glm-independent",
  "title": {
    "ja": "Orszag–Tang：CT・GLMと独立Athena++比較",
    "en": "Orszag–Tang: CT, GLM and independent Athena++"
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "ct",
    "glm"
  ],
  "summary": {
    "ja": "同じ周期Orszag–Tang初期値で、CTとGLMの密度・磁場、保存量、div Bを測り、別に実行したAthena++と比較します。",
    "en": "Compare CT and GLM density, magnetic field, conservation and div B for the same periodic Orszag–Tang data, against separately executed Athena++."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "単位正方形、γ=5/3、μ₀=1、vz=Bz=0、t=0.05。rho=25/(36π)、p=5/(12π)、v=(-sin2πy,sin2πx)、B=(-sin2πy,sin4πx)/sqrt(4π)。",
    "en": "Unit square, gamma=5/3, mu0=1, vz=Bz=0, t=0.05. rho=25/(36pi), p=5/(12pi), v=(-sin2piy,sin2pix), B=(-sin2piy,sin4pix)/sqrt(4pi)."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "公開済みの1次Rusanov/前進Eulerを再利用。CTは共有corner EMFの離散curl、GLMはcell中心Bと双曲・放物型cleaning。Athena++は別実装のHLLD+PLM+RK2。",
    "en": "Reuse the published first-order Rusanov/forward-Euler solvers: shared corner-EMF discrete curl for CT and cell-centered hyperbolic/parabolic GLM cleaning. Independent Athena++ uses HLLD, PLM and RK2."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "16²/32²/64²で密度とByのL1誤差、質量・エネルギードリフト、正値性を測定。独立参照は128²/256²でも収束を確認し、細胞平均を保存的に制限します。",
    "en": "Measure density/By L1 error, mass/energy drift and positivity on 16²/32²/64². Check the independent 128²/256² reference and conservatively restrict its fine-cell averages."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "CTの面上divergenceとGLMの中心差分divergenceは異なる演算子です。共通cell演算子の値も別記します。Athenaの初期磁場はベクトルポテンシャルの差分による面平均で、同じ連続場の離散化差を含みます。短時間の平面MHD比較であり、衝撃波・3D・UCTやCTUの検証ではありません。",
    "en": "Face CT divergence and centered GLM divergence use different operators; common cell-centered diagnostics are also reported. Athena initializes face-averaged magnetic fields by differencing a vector potential, so comparison includes discretization differences of identical continuous data. This is a short planar test, not validation of shocks, 3D, UCT or CTU."
  },
