  "editorial_note": {
    "ja": "採用GLMはch=3、減衰率κ=0.18 ch nです。nは各軸のセル数で、この減衰は格子依存です。同じ連続初期場・終了時刻・CFLを用いますが、CT/GLMで実ステップ数とdiv Bのnative演算子は異なります。",
    "en": "The adopted GLM uses ch=3 and damping rate kappa=0.18 ch n, with n cells per axis: damping is grid dependent. Both use the same continuous initial field, final time and CFL, while actual step counts and native div B operators differ."
  },
